  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "President Prabowo Subianto represented Indonesia at the 2026 APEC CEO Summit, where he advocated for enhanced economic cooperation and fair partnerships across the Asia-Pacific region. His remarks emphasized that collective prosperity is achievable through openness and a shared commitment to innovation. The event featured discussions with global business leaders, such as CATL Chairman Robin Zeng, regarding the role of private sector participation in regional development. This engagement coincides with broader diplomatic efforts by the Indonesian administration to secure significant international investments. Earlier in his state visit to China, the President witnessed the signing of multiple strategic agreements worth more than Rp 1,300 trillion. These diplomatic developments represent a continued focus on fostering stable, mutually beneficial trade relations to support Indonesia's domestic economic goals and long-term industrial ambitions.",
